    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Iriihi na Abhasamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bheni-hatati ömögambi wa Samu, agaköma iricheesi reee rionsui; agasëgëköa na abhagambi bhaandë mërongo ëtatö na bhabhërë hamui na ichibharaasi na amagaari gaabho ga kurutua. Akaya akanaaria umugi go Samaria akaguitania. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakurua, agatöma abhantö bhaae kuya kumugi harë Ahabhu ömögambi wa Isiraeri, na kömöteebhia iga, “Ömögambi Bheni-hatati aragamba iga: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Amatiini gi ichimbiria na ësahaabhu yaao yonsui ni ibhiane; bhakao abharereechu na abhaana bhaao nabho nabhaane’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ömögambi wa Isiraeri akahunchukia iga, “Ömönene waane ömögambi, bhöyö ögambërë mbuuya: Uni nö waao ndë, na bhionsui bhino nënabhio ni ibhiao.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakurua abhatömöa bhaara bhakaringa kuya harë Ahabhu, bhakamöteebhia iga, “Ömögambi Bheni-hatati aragamba iga: ‘Naakörenteeyë amang'ana iga, öng'e ësahaabhu, amatiini gi ichimbiria, bhakao hamui na abhaana bhaao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Köhayö, icho ënkaaga ke ëno, nëndaache ntöme abhakoramërëmo bhaane bhaachë kubhigisiinia inyumba nköraano na ichinyumba cha abhakoramërëmo bhaao, bhaimuki këra gëntö këno këëna ubhuëra nawe.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nëho ömögambi Ahabhu wa Isiraeri, aabhërëkëëyë abhatangati bhonsui bhë ënsë na köbhateebhia iga, “Bhoono, mömaahe kebhörë ömöntö öno agutuna gutunyankia! Aatömërë amang'ana iga, aratuna bhakaane, abhaana bhaane, ësahaabhu na amatiini gi ichimbiria gaane. Nani tëmökaniri hai!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abhagaaka na abhantö bhonsui bhakamöteebhia iga, “Wange götöndörröa nawe, gösë guitabhirria.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igo, Ahabhu agateebhia abhatömöa bhaara bha Bheni-hatati iga, “Genda möteebhi ömönene waane ömögambi iga: ‘Uni ömökoramërëmo waae nitabhirriiyi köhëkërania amatuno gaao gaara ga mbere, sibhoono gano ga kabhërë tëndaitabhirri iga hai.’” Abhatömöa bhaara bhakaherra Bhe-hatati amang'ana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bheni-hatati agatömëra Ahabhu amang'ana iga: “Ndagutueneerria iga, tiga ichinooköë chinyite, hano ndanyoore urutu ro Samaria nduriisa ëgësanyi ge këra umui wa abhantö bhaane bhaano bharëngë abhaaru!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ömögambi Ahabhu wa Isiraeri akahunchukia iga, “Mötateebhia ömögambi Bheni-hatati iga, ömökarë nkuiheema aarë nkaaga asookiri iriihi, sibhoono tënkaaga aratasoha hai.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bheni-hatati akanyoora amang'ana gaara ga Ahabhu nkaaga we na abhagambi bhaara bhaagotaini nawe bhaarëngë kömatunteera gaabho bharanyua. Köhayö agatakia amacheesi gaae kuiraarërra gikugira ya gösoheerröa kumugi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gönkaaga ëyö bheene, ömönaabhi wöndë akagëëra Ahabhu, ömögambi wa Isiraeri na kömöteebhia iga: “ÖMÖNENE aragamba iga, ‘Öramaaha öbhooru bhoa amacheesi gano? Reero röno nëndabhatööre kömabhoko gaao, nawe nöramanye iga uni nu uni ÖMÖNENE.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabhu nawe akabhuuria iga, “Bhoono nkubhutuurria bhong'ui?” Ömönaabhi akagamba iga, “ÖMÖNENE aragamba iga: ‘Nkubhutuurria bhua abhahentani bhano bhagökoorra iricheesi gönsë ya abhagabhana bhö ömöndaara’” Ömögambi nawe akabhuuria iga, “Ning'ui aratange guitana?” Ömönaabhi akamöteebhia iga, “Nuuwe!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igo, ömögambi Ahabhu agaitaaha abhahentani bhano bhakoreeyë iricheesi gönsë ya abhagabhana bhö ömöndaara, bhonsui hamui igo mbaarëngë abhantö amagana abhërë na mërongo ëtatö na bhabhërë (232). Hakurua agaitaaha iricheesi re Isiraeri, mbaarëngë abhasirikare ibhiköë muhungatë (7,000). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hano ömögorobha goohikire, nkaaga wanyoorrë Bhen-Hatati na abhagambi bharikia bhaae mërongo ëtatö na bhabhërë bhaara bhaagotaini nawe bharëngë komatuntera gaabho bharanyua na körehoa, iriihi rëgatanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abhahentani bhaara bhaagakoreeyë iricheesi ëmërëmo hansë ya abhagabhana bhö ömöndaara, bhagatangata. Gönkaaga ëyö, Bheni-hatati, nkanyoora aahiirrë abhasirikare bha körënda, nabho bhakamöteebhia iga, irikomo ria abhantö rërë bhano hano bhaachërë kurua Samaria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bheni-hatati akabhateebhia iga, “Mötabhagoota bhakërëngë abhahoru. Nënkanyoora nkibhuiihi bhachërë gösë kömörembe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igo, abhahentani bhaara bhaakoreeyë iricheesi hansë ya abhagabhana bhö ömöndaara, bhagatanga iriihi, na nyuma yaabho, bhakaroobheröa na abhasirikare bha Isiraeri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Këra umui waabho naitërë umubhisa umui. Abhantö bha Samu bhakaiha köng'osa, na abhasirikare bha Isiraeri bhakabhanyuka; sibhoono Bheni-hatati, ömögambi wa Samu, akariina ëbharaasi hamui na abhasirikare abhagendia-bharaasi nyabhörebhe bhakang'osa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Köhayö, ömögambi wa Isiraeri agakëra iriihi, akameria ichibharaasi na amagaari amaaru ga kurutua, na guita abhantö bha Asuru köbhooru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakurua, ömönaabhi ööra akaya kömögambi wa Isiraeri akamöteebhia iga, “Iseemia bhöhea na guitegeerra ëke gököra, kömooka göno guguucha, ömögambi wa Samu nariicha guiki kuguitania.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Iriihi re kabhërë ria Abhasamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
